    }
  },
  {
    "type": "CompositeElement",
    "element_id": "8bdcdefd5b3e46826b2d14d4455f3ae2",
    "text": "Dieser Text ist für Produt: 2025-003_FRM_H2_Ready_1R0. Produkt ID: RepNews. Der Dokumentyp is RepNews. We’re happy to announce that from 1st April, our medium pressure regulator FRM, FRM-NOC and slam shut valve SAV in sizes up to DN 50 are ready to be used with pure Hydrogen and any blends of it. In a second step in Q3/2025 the bigger sizes will follow. This is out of the result of a material study and tests and the effects of the Hydrogen molecules in the material strength and leakage. This enhancement opens new opportunities for us to meet the growing demand for hydrogen-based solutions in the market.",
    "metadata": {
      "data_source": {
        "record_locator": {
